# Curvine fast POSIX/filesystem semantics gate.
#
# Policy:
# - one or two representative tests per interface family;
# - every entry is selected from the validated syscalls-cv green baseline;
# - no network, loop-device, mount-namespace, pseudo-filesystem, or stress tests;
# - tests run below the Curvine mount supplied through runltp -d.
#
# Keep this suite intentionally small. Add coverage incrementally only after a
# candidate is green in the target Curvine CI environment.

